===Languages===

The official language is [[Volisanian language|Volisanian]], spoken by the vast majority of the population. [[Potocsino Creole]] ({{lang|ca|Crioll Potocsino}}) is spoken by approximately 1.5 million people, primarily in coastal regions. Numerous [[indigenous languages]] are also spoken, including [[Potocsino language|Potocsino]], [[Wayuu]], [[Warao]], and [[Pemon]].

Volisanian in Potocsí has developed some distinctive features compared to the Volisanian spoken in Volisania proper, including vocabulary influenced by indigenous languages and a distinctive accent known as the {{lang|ca|accent potocsino}}.

